------------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY SERVICES
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

FieldOps Pro can optionally call the Anthropic API for narration, severity
classification and remediation guidance. That capability is off unless an API
key is configured, and no feature depends on it: every AI-using script has a
deterministic local path. See DOCS/AI-INTEGRATION.md.

Use of the Anthropic API is governed by Anthropic's own terms, not by this
licence. FieldOps Pro transmits diagnostic findings to that service when the
capability is enabled; operators are responsible for determining whether that
is appropriate for their data.
